			<div class="content" id="post-content-4179824">
									

<p>My entry for the Shaggy Dog theme of JamCon 2019!</p>
<p>It's should and whatever else it is! Thanks to MaliceAF, AbsentmindedNihilist, PopcornK, LordofLaugh, not_a_seagull, elogee and ch00bakka for reading the draft.</p>
<p>I always joke that most of my ideas come from throw away jokes or one-liners said in chat. This time I had the wherewithal to actually save the logs! So, behold my incredible process! (Thanks to Malice for brainstorming this one out with me!)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">The&nbsp;origins&nbsp;of&nbsp;4464</a></div>
