<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>[11:52:07] &lt;Mortos&gt; idea: its like a huge dog<br />
[11:52:09] &lt;Mortos&gt; like, huge<br />
[11:52:13] &lt;Mortos&gt; like 600m tall<br />
[11:52:30] &lt;Mortos&gt; also it lives on the moon<br />
[11:52:42] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; sounds pretty compelling ngl<br />
[11:52:46] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; gotta love a tall doggo<br />
[11:52:58] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; although<br />
[11:53:01] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; .s very tall things<br />
[11:53:02] &lt;Secretary_Helen&gt; MaliceAF: SCP-2256: Very Tall Things (Rating: +411. Written 3 years ago By: qntm) - <a href="http://scp-wiki.net/scp-2256">http://scp-wiki.net/scp-2256</a><br />
[11:53:13] &lt;Mortos&gt; those things are way taller than 600m<br />
[11:53:27] &lt;Mortos&gt; im still sad I havent managed to write a working article that uses &quot;gigafauna&quot;<br />
[11:54:04] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; same<br />
[11:54:15] &lt;Mortos&gt; maybe i'll do it right now<br />
[11:54:17] &lt;Mortos&gt; dog is &gt; 1km tall<br />
[11:54:20] &lt;Mortos&gt; problem solved<br />
[11:54:28] &lt;Mortos&gt; moon dog, 1km tall<br />
[11:54:34] &lt;Mortos&gt; does uh, other things that somehow make it interesting<br />
[11:54:35] &lt;MaliceAF&gt; Mortos: it grows taller due to reduced gravity, obviously<br />
[11:54:41] &lt;Mortos&gt; well OBVIOUSLY<br />
[11:55:01] &lt;Mortos&gt; theres 2 of them<br />
[11:55:04] &lt;Mortos&gt; one on the moon and one in space<br />
[11:55:10] &lt;Mortos&gt; the one in space is huge because of no gravity<br />
[11:55:13] &lt;Mortos&gt; has its own moons<br />
[11:55:15] &lt;Mortos&gt; DOG MOONS</p>
